      "section": "dsh-tool-approval",
      "text": "English | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\nAdd pre-approval to any Tool Calling, aka \"Manual Mode\"/\"Ask Mode\"."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-tool-approval\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Default config",
      "text": "```yml\n- id: tool-approval\n  name: dsh-tool-approval\n```\n\nWith the default config, every Tool Calling goes through pre-approval."
    },
    {
      "section": "Custom config",
      "text": "```yml\n- id: tool-approval\n  name: dsh-tool-approval\n  config:\n    include: [fs_*, web_*]\n\nOnly tools specified in `include` get pre-approval; tools in `exclude` pass through. Wildcards are supported."
    },
